# 2. SUPABASE AUTHENTICATION

Gunakan Supabase Auth.

Login menggunakan:

- Email
- Password

Setelah login:

```text
Login
↓
Supabase Auth
↓
Ambil user_id
↓
Cari profile pengguna
↓
Baca role
↓
Baca assignment
↓
Redirect ke dashboard sesuai role
```

Contoh:

```text
role = guru_wali
→ /guru-wali/dashboard

role = wali_kelas
→ /wali-kelas/dashboard

role = kkk
→ /kkk/dashboard

role = guru_bk
→ /bk/dashboard

role = kesiswaan
→ /kesiswaan/dashboard

role = waka_kesiswaan
→ /waka-kesiswaan/dashboard

role = kepala_sekolah
→ /kepala-sekolah/dashboard

role = admin
→ /admin/dashboard
```

Jangan menyimpan role hanya di frontend.

Role harus divalidasi dari database/RLS.

